{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Woodworm is a grid-based puzzle game about carving bite-sized wooden sculptures. After being magically transformed into a tiny wood-eating grub, your workshop seems so much bigger - and your job will be much more challenging!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404590/extras/movement.gif?t=1750133588\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each puzzle, you must create a specific shape by eating away sections of the wood. You will need to experiment and plan ahead to learn the intricacies of woodcarving and complete each sculpture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This game is an expansion and re-imagining of the original PICO-8 hit WOODWORM - with updated visuals, sound, and even more puzzles!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intuitive, easy-to-learn controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles ranging from simple to surprisingly difficult</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heaps of shapes to carve and tricks to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New wood types with new rules and interactions</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full controller and Steam Deck support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3404590?t=1750133588","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3404590?t=1750133588","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404590/5ef3db99410ad6e4fd6c700fcc8cda01ca6fd9d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750133588","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404590/5ef3db99410ad6e4fd6c700fcc8cda01ca6fd9d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750133588","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Woodworm is a grid-based puzzle game about carving bite-sized wooden sculptures. After being magically transformed into a tiny wood-eating grub, your workshop seems so much bigger - and your job will be much more challenging!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404590/extras/movement.gif?t=1750133588\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each puzzle, you must create a specific shape by eating away sections of the wood. You will need to experiment and plan ahead to learn the intricacies of woodcarving and complete each sculpture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This game is an expansion and re-imagining of the original PICO-8 hit WOODWORM - with updated visuals, sound, and even more puzzles!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intuitive, easy-to-learn controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles ranging from simple to surprisingly difficult</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heaps of shapes to carve and tricks to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New wood types with new rules and interactions</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full controller and Steam Deck support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Samuel Pratt"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404590/c86480761ccca2612f9581ea86191151cc8efba4/header.jpg?t=1750133588","is_free":false,"linux_req